    <title>Past Medical History</title>
    <text><paragraph>Historical biography with true dates. These events are not part of the synthetic care timeline.</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Historical date</th><th>History</th><th>Evidence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>late 1701</td><td>An illness at sea, nature not recorded, that forced him to put in at port on a voyage to the Gulf of Mexico about three and a half years before intake</td><td>D (CLM-0007)</td></tr><tr><td>1702 onward</td><td>Recurrent attacks of illness over the past three years, described by his biographer as malaria, that kept him from planned voyages</td><td>D (CLM-0008)</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

