<component><section><templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.17" extension="2015-08-01"/><code code="29762-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Social history Narrative"/><title>Social History</title><text><list><item>Naval officer and squadron commander; years of service in subarctic waters and on the Gulf of Mexico coast; now ashore preparing a squadron for a tropical deployment expected to sail early next year [S]</item><item>Lives with his family in a port city on the French Atlantic coast [S]</item><item>Tobacco: never. Alcohol: wine with dinner, about eight drinks a week; no other drugs [S]</item><item>Exercise: walks the quays and dockyard most days; sails [S]</item></list></text></section></component>

